# Test coverage
# ANCHORED. Without the leading solidus this pattern matches a directory named
# `coverage` at ANY depth, and it swallowed `tests/coverage/edge-branches.spec.ts`
# — 12 tests that never entered the repository. Local runs read them off disk and
# reported 100 percent; CI, which only ever sees what git tracks, reported 99.29
# percent of lines the first time `pnpm coverage` reached the threshold there.
/coverage/
*.lcov

